# Proof scope: the Coma files the positive proof must discharge. One cargo-creusot
# segment pattern per line (see `cargo creusot --help`, <PATTERN>). run.sh fails if
# a pattern matches no file, so a renamed function cannot silently drop out.
# Every Coma file NOT matched here is out of scope and listed as OPEN in the log.
# The JSON parser (Json, P, parse_json), the decoder (dec_*, req, str_list,
# validate_graph) and acc/check/topo_witness_order are not translated at all:
# lib.rs marks them #[cfg(not(creusot))] because Creusot rejects their recursion
# (a recursive Json type under Vec, mutually recursive parser functions) without
# termination arguments. They stay OPEN; nothing in SCOPE calls them.
